SUMMARY:Film Screenings
DESCRIPTION:The festival provides cinephiles with access to independent films they otherwise would not be able to watch commercially. This year\, the 12th edition of the Saudi Film Festival adopts The Journey as an overarching theme\; reflecting on the production of films\, from a simple idea on paper to a lived experience on screen and the transformations of its creators.
